              "value": "Siphon Magic"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, illusion, mental)\n\nThe sorcerous skull swarm saps magic from nearby creatures. Any creature with the ability to cast spells (including innate spells) in the swarm's space takes 15d6 mental damage (DC 34 basic Will save); on a failure, the creature is also stupefied 2 (stupefied 3 on a critical failure)."
